tepla release assets
--------------------
The statements above describe the standalone companion code in this Git tree.
The tepla-v0.2.1 Release additionally distributes an integrated tepla APK and its
complete corresponding source archive, tepla-0.2.1-source.zip. That archive
preserves the upstream GPL, AGPL and separate third-party notices; this NOTICE
does not relicense those components or authentication materials.

The tepla APK explicitly bundles the experimental runtime accessory identity
already present in the public DiPlay 0.2.12 APK. DiPlay documents its origin as
public Carlinkit C2Air / Allwinner V821 firmware:
https://github.com/shihabal3amri/DiPlay/blob/main/docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md#experimental-authentication-data
It is not a newly issued Apple identity or official CarPlay certification.
Android signing private keys and personal Wi-Fi/pairing data are not included.
